{"id":"ba828dd62ddf0d50","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-boolean-valued-expansion.md","title":"Boolean-Valued Relational Expansion Data","display":"df-boolean-valued-expansion — Boolean-Valued Relational Expansion Data","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-boolean-valued-expansion","aliases":["17-df-boolean-valued-expansion"],"display":"df-boolean-valued-expansion — Boolean-Valued Relational Expansion Data","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]","[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[17-df-reduct]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-6.2.1b","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-boolean-valued-expansion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-boolean-valued-expansion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-valued-expansion — Boolean-Valued Relational Expansion Data"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"906faf39b94540bc\" href=\"?note=906faf39b94540bc\" title=\"17-df-boolean-valued-relation\">17-df-boolean-valued-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" href=\"?note=fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" title=\"17-df-boolean-algebra\">17-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-6.2.1b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(L,L&#39;\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L,L&#39;)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L,L&#39;)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Const}_{L&#39;}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L}\">\\(\\mathrm{Const}_{L&#39;}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L&#39;,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})\">\\(\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L&#39;,n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})\\)</span>；见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f48c896e5c0651df\" href=\"?note=f48c896e5c0651df\" title=\"17-df-reduct\">17-df-reduct</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" href=\"?note=fe577fb2b2dc26d9\" title=\"17-df-boolean-algebra\">17-df-boolean-algebra</a> 的 Boolean algebra。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})\">\\(N=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"906faf39b94540bc\" href=\"?note=906faf39b94540bc\" title=\"17-df-boolean-valued-relation\">17-df-boolean-valued-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BoolExpansion}_{L&#39;/L}\">\\(\\operatorname{BoolExpansion}_{L&#39;/L}\\)</span> 在此定义，候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak E\">\\(\\mathfrak E\\)</span> 是编码数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BoolExpansion}_{L&#39;/L}(\\mathfrak E,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\n\\exists r:N\\to\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathfrak B)\\;\\Bigl[\\mathfrak E=\\langle\\mathfrak A,r\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\nr(R)\\in\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathfrak B)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BoolExpansion}_{L&#39;/L}(\\mathfrak E,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak B)\\land\n\\exists r:N\\to\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathfrak B)\\;\\Bigl[\\mathfrak E=\\langle\\mathfrak A,r\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L&#39;,n}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\nr(R)\\in\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n(|\\mathfrak A|,\\mathfrak B)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是本地辅助数据编码，不把 Boolean 值关系误认作普通结构的关系子集；旧结构由第一投影给出。与原书一般化模型机制的精确对应尚待核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-boolean-valued-relation","status":"resolved","id":"906faf39b94540bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"fe577fb2b2dc26d9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-reduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-reduct","status":"resolved","id":"f48c896e5c0651df","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L,L')$，$\\mathrm{Const}_{L'}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L}$，$\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L',n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})$；见 [[17-df-reduct]]。$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L,L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L,L')$，$\\mathrm{Const}_{L'}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L}$，$\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L',n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})$；见 [[17-df-reduct]]。$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，见 [[17-df-structure]]。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"fe577fb2b2dc26d9","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle$ 是 [[17-df-boolean-algebra]] 的 Boolean algebra。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-boolean-valued-relation","status":"resolved","id":"906faf39b94540bc","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L',n}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})$；$\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n$ 见 [[17-df-boolean-valued-relation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,L'\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sublanguage}_{17}(L,L')","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Const}_{L'}=\\mathrm{Const}_{L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{Func}_{L',n}=\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}(\\mathrm{Rel}_{L',n}\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolRel}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BoolExpansion}_{L'/L}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak E","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{BoolExpansion}_{L'/L}(\\mathfrak E,\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\operatorna